-/**
- \rst
- Formats arguments, writes the result to the output iterator ``out`` and returns
- the iterator past the end of the output range.
-
- **Example**::
-
-   std::vector<char> out;
-   fmt::format_to(std::back_inserter(out), "{}", 42);
